              "html": "Fehlercode"
            },
            {
              "tag": "th",
              "attrs": [],
              "html": "Beschreibung"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [
                [
                  "class",
                  "mono"
                ]
              ],
              "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kOperationCanceled</a>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [],
              "html": "rollback_semantics StateManagement may decide to cancel <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_ExecutionManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_EM_01023\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_ExecutionManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_EM_01023]</a> transition and start specific startup sequence. This could happen for number of reasons and one of them could be interrupted Machine update sequence. Recovery: Call SetState again with initial state"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [
                [
                  "class",
                  "mono"
                ]
              ],
              "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kOperationFailed</a>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [],
              "html": "rollback_semantics if transition to the requested Function Group state failed. Recovery: Call SetState again with initial state"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [
                [
                  "class",
                  "mono"
                ]
              ],
              "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kNoCommunication</a>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [],
              "html": "rollback_semantics if StateClient can’t communicate with Execution Management (e.g. IPC link is down). Recovery: Call function again"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [
                [
                  "class",
                  "mono"
                ]
              ],
              "html": "<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html#SWS_EM_02281\">ara::exec::ExecErrc::kInvalidMetaModelIdentifier</a>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "td",
              "attrs": [],
              "html": "rollback_semantics Process does not have a mapping to MachineFG. Recovery: Indicates configuration problem (should never happen)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"notes\"><b>Hinweise:</b> This method allows State Management to retrieve the result of a transition specified by <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_ExecutionManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_EM_01023\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_ExecutionManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_EM_01023]</a> and <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_ExecutionManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_EM_02241\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_ExecutionManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_EM_02241]</a>. Please note that this transition happens once per machine life cycle, thus the result delivered by this method shall not change (unless machine is started again). Please note that concerns about returned <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html\">ara::core::Future</a> from <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_exec_ara_exec_a73810.html\">ara::exec</a>:: StateClient::SetState apply for <a class=\"vis-internal\" href=\"cl_ara_exec_StateClient_276b21.html\">ara::exec::StateClient</a>:: GetInitialMachineStateTransitionResult.</div>",
      "tail": "\n"
    }
